#41400
Credits Room for Locker area~
This area was originally created by Imhotep at an unknown date.  Because of
locker shortages, more rooms and lockers have been added.  Currently this area
is using zone 411 for the rooms and mobiles.  Objects (the lockers) use zones
411, 412, 413, and 414.

Find out how to add more lockers by using <&08Look addlocker&00>.

Zone Edit by Xiuhtecuhtli 09/23/07
~
414 576 4 0 0 0 255 0
E
addlocker~
&11Adding Lockers&00
Check available objects that the VNUM_ZONE is set to in lockers.c (currently
using zone 413). Use zedit to load the locker object into a room in zone 411.    

&11Creating New Locker Zones&00
Use the tmplocker file as a template (sys/world/obj). Make sure you change 
VNUMS after using the template to the current zone VNUMS you plan to use. Also 
the capacity weight MUST be set to 0 on the locker object. In the src directory 
select lib/specials/lockers.c and edit the VNUM_START, VNUM_MAX, and VNUM_ZONE.
~
S
